  "slug": "coral-lentil-and-turnip-dahl-with-spinach",
  "title": "Coral Lentil and Turnip Dahl with Spinach",
  "blurb": "A warming dahl where sweet turnips soften into red lentils, finished with fresh spinach and parsley.",
  "steps": [
    "Peel and finely chop the onion, then peel and grate the ginger and garlic.",
    "Peel the turnips and cut them into small cubes about one centimetre across.",
    "Heat the oil in a large saucepan over medium heat and cook the onion for five minutes until soft.",
    "Add the ginger, garlic, cumin and turmeric, and cook for one minute until fragrant.",
    "Rinse the lentils under cold water, then add them to the pan with the turnips and stock.",
    "Bring to the boil, reduce to a simmer and cook for twenty minutes until the lentils and turnips are tender.",
    "Roughly chop the parsley and stir it through with the spinach until the leaves wilt.",
    "Season with salt and serve warm."
  ],
